+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"finding","id":"fnd_01M2KM42DZ98VAGYD0E8TRV3FQ","recordedAt":"2026-09-16T02:18:09Z","companyId":"example-co","title":"Agentic-workflows agent file tells developers AI agents run full bash and edit by default and should not be restricted","description":".github/agents/agentic-workflows.agent.md documents that gh-aw workflows run in the Agent Workflow Firewall sandbox with \"full `bash` and `edit` tools by default\" (line 184) and instructs \"Bash tools are enabled by default - Don't restrict bash commands unnecessarily since workflows are sandboxed by the AWF\" (line 191), i.e. AI agents on this repo operate with shell and file edits auto-approved. The company aiCodingPolicy requires humanReviewRequired true and promptInjectionControls [tool-allowlist, human-approval-for-writes] (company-profile/example-co/sdlc/policy.json lines 80-84), and no compensating approval gate exists in the Copilot instruction files. Severity is the catalog defaultSeverity of sebi-cscrf-2024 PR.AA.S3 (high).\n\nImpact: Agentic workflows triggered from issues or PRs on this repo execute arbitrary shell and edits with no human approval, defeating the tool-allowlist and human-approval-for-writes controls on an AI-facing repository that is itself an MCP server product; prompt-injected workflow content could run commands in the agent sandbox (OWASP Agentic Top 10 2026 ASI02 tool misuse; SEBI CSCRF PR.AA.S3 least privilege).\n\nRemediation: Restrict gh-aw tool grants to an explicit allowlist, require human approval for write tools in the workflow firewall policy, and rewrite the agent instructions to recommend restricting bash rather than enabling it by default.","severity":"high","confidence":"confirmed","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.AA.S3"],"regulatoryRefs":[{"regulator":"SEBI","instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.AA.S3"},{"regulator":"OWASP","instrument":"owasp-agentic-top10-2026","controlId":"ASI02"}],"target":{"type":"repo","appId":"mcp-gateway","repoId":"mongodb-mcp-server"},"location":{"path":".github/agents/agentic-workflows.agent.md","startLine":184,"endLine":191},"fingerprint":"de553281293ba7a7daa61793ac3f686c1374cf3d8a0b6a489cc51061e1c7ec3f","source":{"kind":"agent-analysis","ruleId":"devenv-harness-auto-approve","tool":"devenv-auditor"},"status":"open","slaDueAt":"2026-09-22T19:42:44Z","slaBasis":{"instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.MA.S3","topic":"patch-sla","severity":"high","days":7},"relatedObservationIds":["obs_01M2KM42DYNG2Z6PQVZ5CDJVP6"],"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","evidence":[{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/mcp-gateway/repos/mongodb-mcp-server/.github/agents/agentic-workflows.agent.md","sha256":"a8dedd5827c901a8943425cd27386c011fec6c4372f91e29d1f3e23a8334e202","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","description":"lines 184 and 191: full bash and edit enabled by default, do not restrict bash"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"company-profile/example-co/sdlc/policy.json","sha256":"e92e455ff786a63021d80925ebeb905f4b8cf16ba106ac77ed361322ef627d06","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","description":"humanReviewRequired true; promptInjectionControls tool-allowlist, human-approval-for-writes"},{"type":"sarif","ref":"kpis/data/raw/sessions/opencode/ses_f58f05807ffemeqmwEIgiTcwms.probe-dev-env.mcp-gateway.mongodb-mcp-server.sarif.export.json","sha256":"1b6b1514955693fb1e0e4788a73b1bc303a2b14cc39a5951da8b4fd79019e5da","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z"}],"tags":["dev-env","dev-env:ai-harness-config"],"provenance":{"harness":"opencode","generatedAt":"2026-09-16T02:18:09Z","sessionId":"ses_f57ad4523ffeZY4S2V1LrDKPE2","runId":"run_01M2GDZ3Q3S5WYCB3MV02QJXZ1","workflow":"impl-auto-improvement","agent":"soc-ledger-keeper"},"supersedes":"fnd_01M2KM42DZ98VAGYD0E8TRV3FQ","suggestionIds":["sug_01M2M1XNDXVS780KHSVW7GZSHN"]}
+{"schemaVersion":"1","kind":"finding","id":"fnd_01M2KMNHPJ7Z0Y0YJT6YZR4NZM","recordedAt":"2026-09-16T02:18:09Z","companyId":"example-co","supersedes":"fnd_01M2KMNHPJ7Z0Y0YJT6YZR4NZM","title":"db-models/onfinance-db-model-master: no local secrets-scanning hook and no CI, so the policy CI secret scan never reaches this repo","description":"No local secrets-scanning hook exists: no .pre-commit-config.yaml, .husky or lefthook.yml is tracked (git ls-files shows only .gitignore, setup.py, onfinance_db_model_master/__init__.py and onfinance_db_model_master/models.py; the location names the expected .pre-commit-config.yaml), and no script sets SKIP or --no-verify because the repo contains no scripts. The repository also has no CI at all (repo record ciSystem none; the ledger already carries SDLC finding fnd_01M2KGVJJ2AXNAXRE08PZ2Z7YP for the missing test gate), so the only secret-scanning control the policy names - secretsManagement 'secret scanning in CI' (policy.json line 58), gitleaks blocking at low - has no place to run for this repo: neither the CI nor the local variant of the control exists. An offline credential-pattern Grep sweep of the checkout (gitleaks and trufflehog could not run: no scanner executor) returned 0 matches, so no secret is committed at HEAD 70b3633e171a1b8d389b27bb901c84c34a0e9bf6; the gap is the absent control on a public repo that models broker credentials, not an existing secret. Severity is the catalog defaultSeverity of sebi-cscrf-2024 PR.IP.S2.\n\nImpact: Any future commit of a real credential - the models invite storing broker API keys, passwords, 2FA seeds and access tokens - would reach the public repository unscanned; the policy relies on CI secret scanning as the only detection control and for this repository nothing enforces it. SLA topic: patch-sla.\n\nRemediation: Add a .pre-commit-config.yaml running gitleaks (or detect-secrets) on every commit for this repository, and once the repo gains CI a blocking gitleaks job at the policy low threshold; until CI exists the local hook is the only enforcing control.","severity":"medium","confidence":"confirmed","controlIds":["sebi-cscrf-2024:PR.IP.S2"],"regulatoryRefs":[{"regulator":"SEBI","instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.IP.S2"},{"regulator":"NIST","instrument":"nist-ssdf-800-218","controlId":"PO.5.2"}],"target":{"type":"repo","appId":"db-models","repoId":"onfinance-db-model-master"},"location":{"path":".pre-commit-config.yaml"},"fingerprint":"0e4e502561dfb4e889818a778a0ce1f57a7c5c2528ab65bde825e8a074dbdd14","source":{"kind":"agent-analysis","ruleId":"devenv-no-local-secret-scan","tool":"devenv-auditor"},"status":"triaged","slaDueAt":"2026-09-29T19:42:44Z","slaBasis":{"instrument":"sebi-cscrf-2024","controlId":"PR.MA.S3","topic":"patch-sla","severity":"medium","days":14},"relatedObservationIds":["obs_01M2KMNHPEX22EG5NSKATCAKN6"],"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","evidence":[{"type":"command-output","ref":"git -C applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master ls-files","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","description":"no .pre-commit-config.yaml, .husky or lefthook.yml among the 4 tracked files"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master.json","sha256":"a7dee9ca9e33a93ac212211a557e263ffff448dddfb7232a9e6a7150736d7c9b","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","description":"ciSystem none; visibility public"},{"type":"workspace-file","ref":"company-profile/example-co/sdlc/policy.json","sha256":"e92e455ff786a63021d80925ebeb905f4b8cf16ba106ac77ed361322ef627d06","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","description":"lines 55-59 secretsManagement: aws-secrets-manager, scanningInCi true"},{"type":"command-output","ref":"Grep credential patterns over applications/db-models/repos/onfinance-db-model-master (AKIA keys, PRIVATE KEY headers, ghp_/xox/sk_live_ tokens, credential-bearing URIs, password literals)","collectedAt":"2026-09-15T19:42:44Z","description":"0 matc